#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:5
msgid "Copy object"
msgstr "复制对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows copying objects (`element`_, `conductor`_, `text "
"field`_, `basic object`_ and `picture`_) to `paste`_ them at the same "
"`folio`_ or at different `folio`_ and/or `project`_ later."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许复制对象（`元件 <element_>`_ 、`导体 <conductor_>`_ 、`文本字段 <text "
"field_>`_ 、`基本对象 <basic object_>`_ 和 `图片 <picture_>`_ ），以便稍后将其 `粘贴 "
"<paste_>`_ 到同一个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 或不同的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 和/或 `项目 <project_>`_ 中。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:13
msgid ""
"Multiples objects can be copied at the same time `selecting multiple "
"objects`_."
msgstr "可以 `选择多个对象 <selecting multiple objects_>`_ 来同时复制多个对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:17
msgid ""
"The `element`_ would suffer data losses if the intention is to `paste`_ it "
"at different `project`_."
msgstr ""
"如果打算将 `元件 <element_>`_ `粘贴 <paste_>`_ 到其他 `项目 <project_>`_ ，该元件可能会出现数据丢失。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:19
msgid ""
"Copying objects can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click on "
"the object and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "复制对象可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 、右键单击对象以及相应的键盘快捷键完成。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:23
msgid "Copy object from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏复制对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:25 ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:36
#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:61
msgid "`Select the object/s`_ which should be copied."
msgstr "`Select the object/s`_ （选择要复制的对象）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:26
msgid "Select **Edit > Copy** menu item to copy the object."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 复制** 菜单项以复制对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:34
msgid "Copy object from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏复制对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:37
msgid "Select the icon |edit-copy| from `toolbar`_ to copy the object."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择 |edit-copy| 图标以复制对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:39
msgid "edit-copy"
msgstr "复制图标"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:43
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:46
msgid "Copy object by right click"
msgstr "通过右键单击复制对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:48
msgid "Right click on the object which should be copied."
msgstr "右键单击要复制的对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:49
msgid "Select the option **Copy** to copy the object."
msgstr "选择 **复制** 选项以复制对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:54
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 右键单击弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:57
msgid "Copy object using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键复制对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:59
msgid "QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase productivity."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:62
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + c`` to copy the object."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + c`` 复制对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/copy.rst:66
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
